+        # the model's real bounding box is 238x251 and it is not even centred
+        # (46px of empty pixels on the left, 16 on the right). Fitting the raw
+        # 300x300 into the 286x148 region therefore spends 20% of the height on
+        # nothing and lands the model off-centre. Trimming FULLY TRANSPARENT
